{"duration": 55.901, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "The weapon was top secret, and it had to move fast.", "start": 0.08, "end": 2.824}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The artillery branch hated these launchers.", "start": 3.244, "end": 5.346}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Loading and firing 24 rockets took up to 50 minutes.", "start": 5.566, "end": 8.947}, {"beat": 1, "text": "A conventional howitzer could fire 95 to 150 rounds in the same time.", "start": 9.167, "end": 14.412}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The Katyusha was fragile compared to artillery guns.", "start": 14.832, "end": 17.724}, {"beat": 2, "text": "It had to fire a large blow all at once, then move before being located and attacked with counter-battery fire.", "start": 17.944, "end": 24.062}, {"beat": 2, "text": "It was mounted on many platforms during World War II, including trucks, artillery tractors, tanks, and armoured trains.", "start": 24.282, "end": 31.415}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like trying to push a heavy cart through deep snow.", "start": 31.835, "end": 34.653}, {"beat": 3, "text": "A sled spreads the weight and slides over the top.", "start": 34.873, "end": 37.424}, {"beat": 4, "text": "So the Katyusha was mounted on many platforms, including sledges.", "start": 37.844, "end": 41.46}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The sledges let the crew move the launcher across snow to a new spot.", "start": 41.68, "end": 45.229}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The Katyusha was cheap, easy to produce, and usable on almost any chassis.", "start": 45.449, "end": 49.617}, {"beat": 4, "text": "That mobility let it deliver a large blow all at once, then move before being located.", "start": 49.837, "end": 54.781}], "words": [{"w": "The", "start": 0.145, "end": 0.22, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "weapon", "start": 0.27, "end": 0.57, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "was", "start": 0.595, "end": 0.695, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "top", "start": 0.745, "end": 0.995, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "secret,", "start":